    skos:definition "Asserts that a gmeow:CausalLink's gmeow:linkAntecedent and gmeow:linkConsequent must be distinct: nothing type-causes itself. The native coherence gate raises a violation when they coincide."@x-gmeow-english ;
    logic:distinctnessTarget gmeow:CausalLink ;
    logic:distinctnessRole gmeow:linkAntecedent , gmeow:linkConsequent ;
