# ── 3. Event ⊥ Situation (occurrent vs configuration; NO single-field harvest) ───
# The Event/Situation contrast is not stated in a single harvestable annotation
# field; it is a doc-section/foundation harvest over the occurrent structure. This
# candidate therefore omits BOTH logic:candidateFormalizes and
# logic:candidateSourceField (never a half-link). Its sourceHash is the sha256 of
# logic:Event's skos:definition. Enforced by the native DL coherence gate.

